  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining DealPulse Types**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the core TypeScript types for DealPulse. I\'m building out `src/types/dealpulse.ts`, making sure to capture all the essential elements: Deal, MEDDPICC categories, gaps, actions, MCP skills, handoff packets, and actions. This modular approach should help maintain a cleaner and more organized structure going forward.\n\n\n**Constructing the Scenario Data**\n\nI\'ve been creating scenario data now, specifically `src/fixtures/scenarios.ts`, and I\'m generating multi-turn transcripts for both scenario A and B. I\'m also preparing the related CRM opportunity JSON objects, risk scores, and stakeholder info, and they have been given the risk labels of \"Medium\" and \"High\" respectively. My goal is to make these realistic and informative.\n\n\n**Orchestrating Components Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating the orchestrator (`src/engine/orchestrator.ts`) to handle the DealPulse agent\'s coordination, which involves tracking correlation IDs and managing message streams. I\'m focusing on its ability to record actions and generate handoff packets. I\'m also working on integrating the front-end components. I\'ve designed the top bar (`src/components/Header.tsx`), the chat console (`src/components/ChatConsole.tsx`), and the opportunity risk panel (`src/components/OpportunityRiskPanel.tsx`). The panel presents CRM deal summaries and risk score breakdowns.\n\n\n**Building the Interface Elements**\n\nI\'m now deep in building out the UI components, focusing on a detailed right panel. It features tabs for the MCP Skills Registry with interactive cards and a \"Test Skill\" runner, a Handoff OS timeline displaying agent actions and handoff packets, and an Action Ledger with a live, immutable audit log. I\'m also including a modal for full transcript viewing and an architecture drawer visualizing the MCP structure. I\'m aiming for an intuitive and informative interface.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 416203017
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
