  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining UI Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m defining the UI components now. I\'ve started with `src/components/Header.tsx`, which will hold the top bar. It will have the logo, Track 2 subtitle, a scenario selector dropdown (Scenario A and B), and the \"Run Demo\" button.\n\n\n**Adding UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now adding specific UI elements to the components. The `Header` will feature a live status badge. The `ChatConsole` will have real-time execution status indicators. Finally, the `OpportunityRiskPanel` will feature a deal header and a risk score meter.\n\n\n**Constructing Platform Elements**\n\nI\'m currently building out the `PlatformRightPanel.tsx`. It will feature three key enterprise tabs: MCP Skills, Handoff OS, and Action Ledger. The MCP Skills tab, specifically, will contain reusable skill cards. The Handoff OS will have a vertical agent timeline and a verifiable Handoff Packet viewer.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
