  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The Right Panel**\n\nI\'m now focused on building `src/components/PlatformRightPanel.tsx`. The first tab will be dedicated to Skills, drawing data from the MCP Fabric Registry. I\'ll need a header displaying the active skill count, and a search/filter functionality based on namespaces like `crm`, `audio_nlp`, etc.\n\n\n**Building Handoffs View**\n\nI\'ve moved on to designing the second tab, focusing on Handoffs. I\'m visualizing a vertical timeline to represent the flow, with detailed descriptions of agents and their roles. The current Handoff Packet JSON will have a dedicated viewer displaying verification checksum, status, and essential JSON fields like `from_agent`, `to_agent`, `reason`, `risk_score`, etc. I\'m also including a pretty-printed JSON viewer and a copy button to help with usability.\n\n\n"
