  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the production-grade **DealPulse** web application for your Stage-1 submission, positioned specifically around **Track 2 \342\200\224 Platform Agent Skills & Knowledge**:\n\n### Architectural & Functional Implementation\n\n- **Enterprise Aesthetic & Typography**:\n  - Implemented a dark charcoal base (`#0b0f17` / `#0f172a`) paired with electric teal accents, subtle slate grid lines, and high-contrast typography using **Plus Jakarta Sans** for body interfaces and **JetBrains Mono** for correlation IDs, schemas, and ledger entries.\n\n- **3-Column Platform Layout**:\n  - **Left (Agent Console & Dialogue)**: Streams step-by-step MCP orchestrations (e.g., `Calling transcript.analyze\342\200\246`), cites verbatim multi-speaker transcript quotes, supports interactive prompt queries (*\"Why is Economic Buyer weak?\"*, *\"Draft AE brief\"*, *\"Hand off to compliance\"*, *\"Escalate to human deal desk\"*), and renders preview buttons for generated email/ticket artifacts.\n  - **Center (Opportunity Risk Panel)**: Features a real-time 0\342\200\223100 risk score meter with decomposition factors (MEDDPICC weight, objection friction, timeline compression), an 8-dimension MEDDPICC grid (`Metrics`, `Economic Buyer`, `Decision Criteria`, `Decision Process`, `Paper Process`, `Identify Pain`, `Champion`, `Competition`) with validated/weak/missing/blocker states, prioritized deal gaps, and next-best actions with direct skill triggers.\n  - **Right (Platform Panels)**:\n    1. **MCP Skills (Fabric Registry)**: 9 reusable skills (`crm.get_opportunity`, `transcript.analyze`, `meddpicc.extract`, `crm.update_stage`, `crm.add_next_steps`, `email.draft_ae_brief`, `ticket.create_legal_review`, `handoff.route_specialist`, `handoff.to_human`) with schemas, status badges, and test execution runners.\n    2. **Handoff OS**: Vertical agent timeline (DealPulse Primary $\\rightarrow$ Compliance Specialist $\\rightarrow$ Human Deal Desk) paired with a verifiable Handoff Packet viewer featuring SHA-256 checksums, decisions so far, open questions, and transcript citations.\n    3. **Action Ledger**: Immutable audit log capturing timestamp, correlation ID, latency in ms, agent owner, and expandable JSON input/output payload inspectors.\n\n- **Deterministic Analysis Engine & Multi-Scenario Fixtures**:\n  - **Scenario B (Default)**: *\"Late-stage legal block \342\200\224 paper process stalled\"* ($350k ARR, GlobalFin Core Systems) showcasing BaFin EU data residency redlines and Thursday 5 PM board cutoff with automatic routing to the Compliance Specialist Agent.\n  - **Scenario A**: *\"Expanding enterprise \342\200\224 champion weak\"* ($185k ARR, CloudScale Dynamics) highlighting unengaged CFO Marcus Vance, Datadog 25% renewal discount pressure, and AE executive ROI brief generation.\n\n- **Interactive Drawers & Modals**:\n  - **Multi-Speaker Transcript Modal**: Full 8\342\200\22315 turn sales call transcript with speaker badges, timestamps, and highlighted MEDDPICC markers.\n  - **Architecture & Stage 2 Roadmap Drawer**: Visual pipeline flow and blueprint for Freshworks MCP/Agent Studio, ElevenLabs AE voice briefs, live CRM connectors, and automated eval benchmarks.\n  - **Artifact Modal**: Dedicated inspector and clipboard copier for generated outreach emails and legal review tickets."
    modified_response: "I have completed the production-grade **DealPulse** web application for your Stage-1 submission, positioned specifically around **Track 2 \342\200\224 Platform Agent Skills & Knowledge**:\n\n### Architectural & Functional Implementation\n\n- **Enterprise Aesthetic & Typography**:\n  - Implemented a dark charcoal base (`#0b0f17` / `#0f172a`) paired with electric teal accents, subtle slate grid lines, and high-contrast typography using **Plus Jakarta Sans** for body interfaces and **JetBrains Mono** for correlation IDs, schemas, and ledger entries.\n\n- **3-Column Platform Layout**:\n  - **Left (Agent Console & Dialogue)**: Streams step-by-step MCP orchestrations (e.g., `Calling transcript.analyze\342\200\246`), cites verbatim multi-speaker transcript quotes, supports interactive prompt queries (*\"Why is Economic Buyer weak?\"*, *\"Draft AE brief\"*, *\"Hand off to compliance\"*, *\"Escalate to human deal desk\"*), and renders preview buttons for generated email/ticket artifacts.\n  - **Center (Opportunity Risk Panel)**: Features a real-time 0\342\200\223100 risk score meter with decomposition factors (MEDDPICC weight, objection friction, timeline compression), an 8-dimension MEDDPICC grid (`Metrics`, `Economic Buyer`, `Decision Criteria`, `Decision Process`, `Paper Process`, `Identify Pain`, `Champion`, `Competition`) with validated/weak/missing/blocker states, prioritized deal gaps, and next-best actions with direct skill triggers.\n  - **Right (Platform Panels)**:\n    1. **MCP Skills (Fabric Registry)**: 9 reusable skills (`crm.get_opportunity`, `transcript.analyze`, `meddpicc.extract`, `crm.update_stage`, `crm.add_next_steps`, `email.draft_ae_brief`, `ticket.create_legal_review`, `handoff.route_specialist`, `handoff.to_human`) with schemas, status badges, and test execution runners.\n    2. **Handoff OS**: Vertical agent timeline (DealPulse Primary $\\rightarrow$ Compliance Specialist $\\rightarrow$ Human Deal Desk) paired with a verifiable Handoff Packet viewer featuring SHA-256 checksums, decisions so far, open questions, and transcript citations.\n    3. **Action Ledger**: Immutable audit log capturing timestamp, correlation ID, latency in ms, agent owner, and expandable JSON input/output payload inspectors.\n\n- **Deterministic Analysis Engine & Multi-Scenario Fixtures**:\n  - **Scenario B (Default)**: *\"Late-stage legal block \342\200\224 paper process stalled\"* ($350k ARR, GlobalFin Core Systems) showcasing BaFin EU data residency redlines and Thursday 5 PM board cutoff with automatic routing to the Compliance Specialist Agent.\n  - **Scenario A**: *\"Expanding enterprise \342\200\224 champion weak\"* ($185k ARR, CloudScale Dynamics) highlighting unengaged CFO Marcus Vance, Datadog 25% renewal discount pressure, and AE executive ROI brief generation.\n\n- **Interactive Drawers & Modals**:\n  - **Multi-Speaker Transcript Modal**: Full 8\342\200\22315 turn sales call transcript with speaker badges, timestamps, and highlighted MEDDPICC markers.\n  - **Architecture & Stage 2 Roadmap Drawer**: Visual pipeline flow and blueprint for Freshworks MCP/Agent Studio, ElevenLabs AE voice briefs, live CRM connectors, and automated eval benchmarks.\n  - **Artifact Modal**: Dedicated inspector and clipboard copier for generated outreach emails and legal review tickets."
