l path, focusing on the steps\' timings within the demo sequence. I\'ve broken it down between 7 and 21 seconds. The initial MEDDPICC grid is now populating, the risk score is ticking up, and new ledger entries appear. I\'m focusing on the \"Paper Process\" blocker and the BaFin telemetry. The CRM stage has moved to \"At Risk / Legal Review,\" and the automated handoff to the Compliance Specialist is in progress, with the OS timeline activating a Compliance node.\n\n\n**Finalizing Sequence Details**\n\nNow I\'m finalizing the demo. I\'m focusing on the final phase, which includes the expedited legal review and task generation, leading to the completion message with actionable CTA buttons. I\'ve also pivoted to consider Scenario A, planning a streamlined sequence. I\'m investigating the `ChatMessage` type and `ChatConsole` integration, specifically focusing on how to render CTA buttons within the chat messages for quick user actions.\n\n\n"
