    response: "I have upgraded the **MCP Skills tab** in the Platform panel:\n\n- **Track 2 Header Banner**: Added a high-contrast banner featuring the exact value proposition:\n  > **\"Build skills once. Any agent can call them.\"** \342\200\224 Modular MCP tools decoupled from agent business logic.\n- **Reusable Client Badge**: Attached the highlighted badge **`\"Reusable across any agent client\"`** in the top-right of the Skills view.\n- **Grid Layout for Skill Cards**: Re-architected the skills registry into a responsive 2-column card grid displaying skill names, namespaces, versioning tags, descriptions, and real-time execution status tags.\n- **Interactive Last Invocation I/O Inspector**: Clicking any skill card expands an inspector showing its most recent **Inputs Payload** and **Outputs Payload** directly queried from the **Action Ledger**, along with its formal MCP schema specifications. Users can also click **\"Run\"** on any card to test the skill in isolation."
    modified_response: "I have upgraded the **MCP Skills tab** in the Platform panel:\n\n- **Track 2 Header Banner**: Added a high-contrast banner featuring the exact value proposition:\n  > **\"Build skills once. Any agent can call them.\"** \342\200\224 Modular MCP tools decoupled from agent business logic.\n- **Reusable Client Badge**: Attached the highlighted badge **`\"Reusable across any agent client\"`** in the top-right of the Skills view.\n- **Grid Layout for Skill Cards**: Re-architected the skills registry into a responsive 2-column card grid displaying skill names, namespaces, versioning tags, descriptions, and real-time execution status tags.\n- **Interactive Last Invocation I/O Inspector**: Clicking any skill card expands an inspector showing its most recent **Inputs Payload** and **Outputs Payload** directly queried from the **Action Ledger**, along with its formal MCP schema specifications. Users can also click **\"Run\"** on any card to test the skill in isolation."
