  planner_response {
    response: "I have upgraded the **Handoffs OS** and **Platform Agent Skills** architecture with production-grade incident transfer notes and human-in-the-loop escalation controls:\n\n### What Was Built & Enhanced\n\n- **Production Incident Transfer Note UI**:\n  - Structured the Handoff Packet viewer to reflect enterprise incident transfer standards with dual viewing modes (**Incident Note Spec View** and **Raw JSON Payload**).\n  - Explicitly rendered all core handoff attributes: **Evidence Quotes** (with speaker attribution and context), **Risk Score & Severity Badges**, **MEDDPICC Gaps**, **Decisions So Far**, **Open Questions**, and **Recommended Owner**.\n  - Displayed cryptographic SHA-256 Checksums and correlation ID validation markers for verifiable agent-to-agent-to-human handoffs.\n\n- **Human Escalation Control & Safety Freeze**:\n  - Implemented the **\"Escalate to Human\"** button within both the **Handoffs OS** tab and the **Next-Best Actions** drawer.\n  - Clicking escalation immediately appends an active **Human Deal Desk Lead** node to the agent timeline, logs an audit entry to the **Action Ledger**, and displays an incident alert in the chat stream.\n  - Freezes autonomous execution across the dashboard, placing action dispatch buttons into a locked state pending Deal Desk executive review."
    modified_response: "I have upgraded the **Handoffs OS** and **Platform Agent Skills** architecture with production-grade incident transfer notes and human-in-the-loop escalation controls:\n\n### What Was Built & Enhanced\n\n- **Production Incident Transfer Note UI**:\n  - Structured the Handoff Packet viewer to reflect enterprise incident transfer standards with dual viewing modes (**Incident Note Spec View** and **Raw JSON Payload**).\n  - Explicitly rendered all core handoff attributes: **Evidence Quotes** (with speaker attribution and context), **Risk Score & Severity Badges**, **MEDDPICC Gaps**, **Decisions So Far**, **Open Questions**, and **Recommended Owner**.\n  - Displayed cryptographic SHA-256 Checksums and correlation ID validation markers for verifiable agent-to-agent-to-human handoffs.\n\n- **Human Escalation Control & Safety Freeze**:\n  - Implemented the **\"Escalate to Human\"** button within both the **Handoffs OS** tab and the **Next-Best Actions** drawer.\n  - Clicking escalation immediately appends an active **Human Deal Desk Lead** node to the agent timeline, logs an audit entry to the **Action Ledger**, and displays an incident alert in the chat stream.\n  - Freezes autonomous execution across the dashboard, placing action dispatch buttons into a locked state pending Deal Desk executive review."
