        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Core Components"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Decoupled MCP Skill Registry (`src/mcp/registry.ts`)**: 9 modular, reusable skills conforming to MCP schema specifications (`crm`, `analysis`, `comms`, `compliance`, `orchestration`)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Deterministic Orchestrator (`src/engine/orchestrator.ts`)**: Autonomous deal supervisor that runs multi-step diagnostic pipelines across sales data with zero external dependencies in Stage-1 demo mode."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Action Ledger**: Immutable audit log recording correlation IDs, millisecond latencies, inputs, and outputs for every tool invocation."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **Handoffs OS & Incident Transfer**: Verifiable agent-to-specialist-to-human handoff packets featuring SHA-256 checksums, verbatim evidence quotes, MEDDPICC gaps, and a safety-freeze \"Escalate to Human\" control."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## \360\237\232\200 Run Locally"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "DealPulse is built as a pure client-side SPA (Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS). It requires **no server** for the Stage-1 demo."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Prerequisites"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- Node.js 18+ or 20+"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "- npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Step-by-Step"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```bash"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# 1. Clone the repository"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "git clone https://github.com/your-org/dealpulse.git"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "cd dealpulse"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# 2. Install dependencies"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "npm install"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# 3. (Optional) Configure Gemini API key for dynamic generation"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# Create .env or .env.local:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# If omitted, DealPulse runs seamlessly in 100% offline deterministic demo mode!"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# 4. Start local development server"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "npm run dev"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# 5. Open http://localhost:3000 in your browser"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## \342\230\201\357\270\217 Deploy to Cloudflare Pages"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "DealPulse compiles to static HTML/JS/CSS, making it natively compatible with **Cloudflare Pages** with zero configuration."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Option A: Cloudflare Dashboard (Git Integration)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. Go to the **Cloudflare Dashboard** \342\206\222 **Workers & Pages** \342\206\222 **Create application** \342\206\222 **Pages** \342\206\222 **Connect to Git**."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. Select your `dealpulse` repository."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. Configure Build Settings:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Framework preset**: `Vite`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Build command**: `npm run build`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Build output directory**: `dist`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Root directory**: `/`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. *(Optional)* Add Environment Variables in **Settings** \342\206\222 **Environment variables**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - `VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY`: `(Your Gemini API Key)`"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. Click **Save and Deploy**."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "### Option B: Cloudflare Wrangler CLI (Direct Upload)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```bash"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# 1. Build the production bundle"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "npm run build"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "# 2. Deploy directly to Cloudflare Pages"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "npx wrangler pages deploy dist --project-name=dealpulse"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "```"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## \360\237\227\272\357\270\217 Stage-2 Roadmap"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| Milestone | Capability | Description |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| :--- | :--- | :--- |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Stage 2.1** | **Cloudflare D1 / KV Persistence** | Store Action Ledger events and custom uploaded call transcripts in edge SQL tables. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Stage 2.2** | **Live Gemini Multi-Modal Ingestion** | Real-time audio streaming and speech-to-text diarization via the Gemini Live API. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Stage 2.3** | **Bi-Directional MCP Endpoints** | Expose DealPulse MCP skills over JSON-RPC HTTP/SSE for external agent consumption (Cursor, Claude, Copilot). |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Stage 2.4** | **Native CRM Connectors** | Live two-way synchronization with Salesforce, HubSpot, and Gong. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "| **Stage 2.5** | **Automated Paging & Slack War Rooms** | Automatic PagerDuty escalation and Slack canvas generation when deal risk exceeds threshold. |"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "## \360\237\216\254 2-Minute Demo Script (Evaluator Walkthrough)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "Follow these steps for a complete evaluation of DealPulse:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Select Scenario B**: In the top navigation bar, ensure **\"Scenario B: Late-stage legal block (High Risk - $350k)\"** is selected."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Execute Autonomous Orchestration**: Click **\"Run Demo\"** in the header."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Observe the live execution progress bar and real-time chat messages as the orchestrator dispatches `crm.get_opportunity`, `transcript.analyze`, `meddpicc.extract`, and `legal.generate_addendum`."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Watch the Deal Risk Score dynamically update from 18 to 84 (Critical)."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Inspect MEDDPICC Gaps**: In the center panel, view the 8 scored dimensions and click on **Critical Gaps** to see the missing Paper Process redline."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "4. **Explore the MCP Skills Registry**: In the right panel, open the **MCP Skills** tab. Click any skill card (e.g. `legal.generate_addendum` or `meddpicc.extract`) to view its formal MCP schema and inspect its live input/output payload recorded in the ledger."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "5. **Audit Handoffs OS & Escalate to Human**: Switch to the **Handoffs OS** tab."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Review the verified SHA-256 Checksum, verbatim Evidence Quotes, and MEDDPICC Gaps in the **Incident Transfer Note**."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Click the **\"Escalate to Human\"** button. Notice how a human executive node is appended, the Action Ledger records the event, and autonomous actions are frozen to prevent unauthorized edits."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "6. **Verify Action Ledger**: Switch to the **Action Ledger** tab to audit the full log of executed skills, correlation IDs, and millisecond latencies."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
      }
    }
    overwrite: true
  }
