  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the refactoring for **Cloudflare Pages** deployment:\n\n### Key Highlights & Changes\n\n1. **Pure Client-Side Vite Architecture (No Server Required)**:\n   - Preserved the modern **Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS** SPA stack.\n   - Built to output a standalone static bundle directly into `dist/` compatible with Cloudflare Pages, Vercel, Netlify, or GitHub Pages.\n\n2. **Self-Contained Local Fixtures & Offline Execution**:\n   - `SCENARIO_A` and `SCENARIO_B` multi-turn transcript fixtures, CRM opportunity graphs, and all 9 modular MCP skill simulators run 100% locally with zero external network dependencies required for the Stage-1 demo.\n\n3. **Optional `VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY` Integration**:\n   - Added a safe, lazy client utility (`src/engine/geminiService.ts`) that checks `import.meta.env.VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY`.\n   - If configured on Cloudflare Pages or in a local `.env`, dynamic AI capabilities can be optionally leveraged; if omitted, the app operates smoothly in deterministic demo mode.\n   - Documented the optional key in `.env.example`.\n\n4. **Concise `README.md`**:\n   - **Overview**: System purpose, Track 2 value proposition (*\"Build skills once. Any agent can call them\"*), and core architecture.\n   - **Architecture Diagram & Breakdown**: Decoupled MCP Skill Registry, Orchestration Engine, Action Ledger, and Handoffs OS.\n   - **Run Locally**: Clear step-by-step commands (`npm install`, `npm run dev`).\n   - **Deploy to Cloudflare Pages**: Exact build command (`npm run build`), output directory (`dist`), preset (`Vite`), and Wrangler CLI instructions (`npx wrangler pages deploy dist`).\n   - **Stage-2 Roadmap**: Cloudflare D1/KV persistence, Gemini multi-modal live audio ingestion, bidirectional MCP server adapters, and automated alerting.\n   - **2-Minute Demo Script**: Step-by-step judge and evaluator walkthrough guide."
    modified_response: "I have completed the refactoring for **Cloudflare Pages** deployment:\n\n### Key Highlights & Changes\n\n1. **Pure Client-Side Vite Architecture (No Server Required)**:\n   - Preserved the modern **Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS** SPA stack.\n   - Built to output a standalone static bundle directly into `dist/` compatible with Cloudflare Pages, Vercel, Netlify, or GitHub Pages.\n\n2. **Self-Contained Local Fixtures & Offline Execution**:\n   - `SCENARIO_A` and `SCENARIO_B` multi-turn transcript fixtures, CRM opportunity graphs, and all 9 modular MCP skill simulators run 100% locally with zero external network dependencies required for the Stage-1 demo.\n\n3. **Optional `VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY` Integration**:\n   - Added a safe, lazy client utility (`src/engine/geminiService.ts`) that checks `import.meta.env.VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY`.\n   - If configured on Cloudflare Pages or in a local `.env`, dynamic AI capabilities can be optionally leveraged; if omitted, the app operates smoothly in deterministic demo mode.\n   - Documented the optional key in `.env.example`.\n\n4. **Concise `README.md`**:\n   - **Overview**: System purpose, Track 2 value proposition (*\"Build skills once. Any agent can call them\"*), and core architecture.\n   - **Architecture Diagram & Breakdown**: Decoupled MCP Skill Registry, Orchestration Engine, Action Ledger, and Handoffs OS.\n   - **Run Locally**: Clear step-by-step commands (`npm install`, `npm run dev`).\n   - **Deploy to Cloudflare Pages**: Exact build command (`npm run build`), output directory (`dist`), preset (`Vite`), and Wrangler CLI instructions (`npx wrangler pages deploy dist`).\n   - **Stage-2 Roadmap**: Cloudflare D1/KV persistence, Gemini multi-modal live audio ingestion, bidirectional MCP server adapters, and automated alerting.\n   - **2-Minute Demo Script**: Step-by-step judge and evaluator walkthrough guide."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
